{"updated_at":"2026-08-23T05:26:22+08:00","frags":{"cross":"\n<div class=\"con-scenario\"><div class=\"con-tagcell\">SCENARIO<span>判讀</span></div><div class=\"con-body\"><details class=\"event-panel\" id=\"judgment\" style=\"background:#12151c;border:1px solid #2a3140;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 12px;scroll-margin-top:64px\"><summary style=\"list-style:none;cursor:pointer;outline:none\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #232a36;padding-bottom:5px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700\"><svg class=\"ic\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px;vertical-align:-2px\"><use href=\"#i-insight\"/></svg> 判讀</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">2026-08-21 · 公開版</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#6b7385\">· 資料 10:40</span></div><div style=\"background:rgba(251,146,60,.1);border:1px solid rgba(251,146,60,.34);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 11px;margin-bottom:9px;font-size:11.5px;color:#ffc89e\">⏳ 今日判讀更新中 — 以下為 08-21 版判讀</div><style id=\"sdscn-style\">\n/* SCENARIO 分岔航路圖 v4：NOW 幹線 → 三條航道（長度/厚度=機率）＋航道上的絆線 */\n.scn-fork{position:relative;padding-left:26px;padding-top:15px;margin:4px 0 0}\n.scn-fork::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:9px;top:11px;bottom:20px;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ff8a3d66,#8a93a6,#2a3140)}\n.scn-now{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#ff8a3d}\n.scn-now i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff8a3d;box-shadow:0 0 9px rgba(255,138,61,.8)}\n.scn-route{position:relative;margin:8px 0;padding-left:2px}\n.scn-route::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-17px;top:calc(var(--bh)/2 + 1px);width:17px;height:2px;background:var(--c);opacity:.55}\n.scn-lane{min-width:0}\n.scn-rbar{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;height:var(--bh);width:var(--w);min-width:140px;max-width:100%;padding:0 8px;border:1px solid var(--c);background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:inset 0 0 14px -8px var(--c)}\n.scn-rbar::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 12px,rgba(255,255,255,.05) 12px 15px)}\n.scn-route.scn-max .scn-rbar{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--c),inset 0 0 22px -8px var(--c),0 0 14px -6px var(--c)}\n.scn-route.scn-max .scn-rbar::after{animation:scnflow 2.6s linear infinite}\n@keyframes scnflow{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(15px)}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.scn-route.scn-max .scn-rbar::after{animation:none}}\n.scn-rbar b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--c);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1}\n.scn-rbar em{font-style:normal;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--c);opacity:.9;white-space:nowrap}\n.scn-rbar .cap{margin-left:auto;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--c);flex:0 0 auto}\n.scn-trip{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;margin-top:3px;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#cdd6e4}\n.scn-trip .tw{flex:0 0 auto;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--c);opacity:.75;border:1px solid var(--c);padding:0 4px;transform:translateY(-1px)}\n.scn-trip .cl{color:#7d8799}\n.twn{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#e8edf2;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:0 4px;margin:0 1px;white-space:nowrap}\n@media(max-width:560px){.scn-rbar{width:100%!important}.scn-trip{flex-wrap:wrap}}\n</style><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#8a93a6;margin:0 0 3px\">SCENARIO TREE · 情境分岔 機率加權</div><div class=\"scn-fork\"><div class=\"scn-now\"><i></i>NOW</div><div class=\"scn-route scn-max\" style=\"--c:#4ade80;--bg:rgba(74,222,128,.07);--bh:22px\"><div class=\"scn-lane\"><div class=\"scn-rbar\" style=\"width:100%\"><b>55%</b><em>基準</em><span class=\"cap\"></span></div><div class=\"scn-trip\"><span class=\"tw\">TRIPWIRE</span><span><span class=\"cl\">—</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"scn-route\" style=\"--c:#fbbf24;--bg:rgba(251,191,36,.07);--bh:13px\"><div class=\"scn-lane\"><div class=\"scn-rbar\" style=\"width:66%\"><b>30%</b><em>風險</em><span class=\"cap\"></span></div><div class=\"scn-trip\"><span class=\"tw\">TRIPWIRE</span><span><span class=\"cl\">—</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"scn-route\" style=\"--c:#f87171;--bg:rgba(248,113,113,.07);--bh:13px\"><div class=\"scn-lane\"><div class=\"scn-rbar\" style=\"width:45%\"><b>15%</b><em>尾端</em><span class=\"cap\"></span></div><div class=\"scn-trip\"><span class=\"tw\">TRIPWIRE</span><span><span class=\"cl\">—</span></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"judg-hint\" style=\"margin-top:5px;font-size:11px;color:#60a5fa;user-select:none\">展開完整判讀（情境 · 判讀 · 要聞 · 建議）▾</div></summary><div style=\"margin-top:4px\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;border-left:2px solid #4ade80;background:rgba(74,222,128,.07);padding:6px 11px;margin:4px 0\"><span style=\"color:#4ade80;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap\">基準</span><span style=\"color:#c3cad6\">油價 90–96 區間盤整，TWII 44,500–45,500 窄幅等待 NVIDIA，財報符合或優於預期 → 週線收紅、SOX 續強 → 觸發：NVIDIA 營收指引 ≥ 市場共識 +5%；否證：Brent 破 96 或 PCE 年增 &gt; 3.0%</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;border-left:2px solid #fbbf24;background:rgba(251,191,36,.07);padding:6px 11px;margin:4px 0\"><span style=\"color:#fbbf24;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap\">風險</span><span style=\"color:#c3cad6\">荷莫茲局勢實質升級或 PCE 偏熱 → 油價衝 96–100、VIX 破 20、美債殖利率逼近 4.80%，TWII 回測 43,500 → 觸發：伊朗反制措施落地或 PCE 年增 ≥ 3.2%</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;border-left:2px solid #f87171;background:rgba(248,113,113,.07);padding:6px 11px;margin:4px 0\"><span style=\"color:#f87171;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap\">尾端</span><span style=\"color:#c3cad6\">荷莫茲通行實質受阻＋NVIDIA 財報 miss → Brent 破 100、VIX 逼 25、全面 risk-off，TWII 下探 42,000 → 觸發：油輪通行量驟降 + NVIDIA 下修指引</span></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#fbbf24;margin:14px 0 6px\">EDITORIAL · 判讀 首席觀點</div><div style=\"border-left:2px solid #fbbf24;background:rgba(251,191,36,.04);padding:8px 12px\"><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#dbe2ec\">油價對利空已經鈍化，這是今天和昨天最大的不同。連三天荷莫茲頭條從「僵局」升級到「前所未有制裁」，但 Brent 從 93.78 動到 93.74，價格告訴你風險溢價已經 priced in——至少在當前供給沒有實質中斷的前提下。VIX 跳升 7.52% 至 16.01 不是在反映油價，是在反映下週：8/26 同一天 NVIDIA 財報和 PCE 物價指數公布，8/27 起 Jackson Hole 央行年會，三件事壓在 72 小時內。這才是市場正在換檔防禦的對象。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#dbe2ec\">本庫氣壓場維持 -2「偏逆風」，兩個逆風源是美債殖利率 4.65% 和期貨籌碼淨空 -8.2 萬口，油價反而被歸為中性。這和盤面一致：油不是增量壓力，債才是。族群訊號榜上紡織纖維（81.4）和航運（42.0）領先，兩者都受惠弱美元與高運價，是「貶值交易」的直接受益者。SOX 與 Nasdaq 背離也值得注意——記憶體擴產消息密集，AI 硬體敘事仍在撐住半導體估值。本庫 08/19 嘉澤報告評 watch、fair value 1,675，今日新聞指其 Q2 毛利率受原料大漲壓縮、管理層坦言明年才好轉，與報告觀察方向一致，該判讀基於 08/19 數據。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#dbe2ec\">下週的關鍵節點極度集中：8/26 NVIDIA 若 guide 強勁且 PCE 溫和，目前 -2 的氣壓場有機會翻正，SOX 領漲邏輯延續；Jackson Hole 聯準會措辭若偏鷹（油價推高通膨預期），美債 4.65% 這個逆風會再升級。</div></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#60a5fa;margin:14px 0 6px\">WIRE · 要聞 主編快報</div><div style=\"border-left:2px solid #60a5fa;background:rgba(96,165,250,.04);padding:8px 12px\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">加權 45224.3<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+0.65%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">台積電 2410<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+1.47%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">費半 11740.4<span style=\"color:#f87171;margin-left:5px\">-0.51%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">VIX 15.13<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">-5.50%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">WTI 87.06<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+0.26%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">Brent 94.39<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+0.65%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">黃金 4680.6<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+2.39%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">DXY 98.839<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+0.04%</span></span></div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#c3cad6\">川普威脅對援助伊朗國家施加「前所未有」制裁，荷莫茲海峽重啟談判陷僵局，隔夜油價一度飆逾 2%。但截至今早，Brent 93.74 與前收 93.78 幾乎持平，WTI 86.76 同樣原地踏步——市場已消化了這輪制裁口頭升級。（news_monitor 2026-08-21 10:27；CRITICAL 18 / HIGH 142）</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#c3cad6\">黃金正式站上 4,500 美元上方，現報 4,582。美元指數 DXY 98.736 持續走弱（-0.16%），避險資金持續流入貴金屬而非美元，反映的是通膨預期而非單純恐慌。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#c3cad6\">記憶體供應鏈兩則重磅同日出爐：SK 海力士傳砸數十兆韓圜在日本宮城設晶片廠，美光增持 100 億美元在美設 AI 記憶體研發中心。疊加 8/27 SK 海力士印第安納先進封裝廠動工，記憶體軍備賽在一週內連續落地。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#c3cad6\">隔夜美股分裂收場：S&amp;P 500 跌 0.87% 至 7,641、Nasdaq 跌 1.0%，但 SOX 逆勢漲 0.53% 至 11,800。台積電 ADR 416.0（+0.95%），今早台股台積電 2,390（+0.63%），加權指數 45,052（+0.26%）——半導體自成一格，大盤弱勢中撐盤。</div></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#4ade80;margin:14px 0 6px\">ACTION · 建議 須人審</div><div style=\"border-left:2px solid #4ade80;background:rgba(74,222,128,.05);padding:8px 12px\"><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#cdd6e4\">公開觀察，非交易指令，須人審：</div><div style=\"margin:3px 0 3px 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#cdd6e4\">• 盯 Brent 96：若本週收盤仍壓在 96 以下，油價鈍化確認，地緣溢價封頂；破 96 則重新定價供給風險。</div><div style=\"margin:3px 0 3px 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#cdd6e4\">• 8/26 NVIDIA＋PCE 同日：這是本輪氣壓場能否翻正的分水嶺，觀察 NVIDIA 盤後 ±5% 反應幅度與 PCE 年增是否壓在 2.8% 以下。</div><div style=\"margin:3px 0 3px 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#cdd6e4\">• SOX vs Nasdaq 背離延續性：若下週一 SOX 補跌收斂背離，AI 硬體短期支撐鬆動；若持續領先，記憶體擴產題材有撐。</div><div style=\"margin:3px 0 3px 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#cdd6e4\">• 驗證本庫嘉澤 fair value 1,675（08/19 數據）：Q2 毛利率受創已見報，觀察法說會是否下修全年展望，若下修則 watch 評等面臨再評估。</div></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;color:#8a93a6;border-top:1px solid #232a36;margin-top:14px;padding-top:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#aab3c2\">DELTA · 與昨日差異</span><br>軸轉移——昨日「油價地緣風險第一順位」，今日油價對升級制裁幾乎零反應（Brent -0.04%），風險軸前移至下週三重事件（NVIDIA＋PCE＋Jackson Hole），VIX 跳升 7.5% 印證市場已在換檔。</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#525c70;margin-top:11px\">來源：news_monitor / Yahoo Finance snapshot / 2026 事件軸 / Sixdust 研究庫。資料時間：2026-08-21 10:40 GMT+8。本稿為公開市場與族群層級判讀，非投資建議。</div></div></details>\n<style>#judgment>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}</style>\n<script>(function(){var d=document.getElementById('judgment');if(!d||d.tagName!=='DETAILS')return;\nvar h=d.querySelector('.judg-hint');function u(){if(h)h.textContent=d.open?'收合判讀 ▴':'展開完整判讀（情境 · 判讀 · 要聞 · 建議）▾'}\nd.addEventListener('toggle',u);u();\nfunction o(){if(location.hash==='#judgment')d.open=true}addEventListener('hashchange',o);o();\ndocument.addEventListener('click',function(e){var a=e.target&&e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('a[href=\"#judgment\"]');if(a)d.open=true});\n})();</script></div></div>\n","tw":"\n<div class=\"uc-row\"><div class=\"uc-tag\">NEWS<span>新聞室</span></div><div class=\"uc-body\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;min-height:0;padding-top:9px;padding-bottom:9px\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#f87171;background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,.4);border-radius:100px;padding:2px 11px;letter-spacing:.02em;white-space:nowrap;flex:none\"><span style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f87171;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(248,113,113,.18)\"></span>事件風險 · 地緣-油<span style=\"opacity:.75\"> · 第 41 日</span></span><a href=\"/news_events.html\" style=\"margin-left:auto;color:#60a5fa;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap\">完整新聞室 →</a></span><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:7px;min-width:0\"><span style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#fb923c;flex:none;align-self:center\"></span><a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQWHUxdlVNVGlSTFBwUlFnNVl3dTI5SUd0bFVmMlFjQmxQUmVhTjhLbkNqR3p3N2dzVWJ0NXhmVFJrem85MkpDbHB2NmZrVS1xaUo5OTd6NENmTHhnVU1fbmxtX0tVM1BBYzRwWmdOd2hRZW1yeGFjV2R